The function is already a single forwarding call with no work of its own, so the only safe drop-in is the identical body; any further gain would require changing `SetUINT64Value`, which is out of scope.
```cpp
void FieldBase::SetUINT64ZValue(const FIT_UINT64Z value, const FIT_UINT8 fieldArrayIndex)
{
    SetUINT64Value(value, fieldArrayIndex);
}
```